  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If possible, allow for one VRChat world to have multiple scenes that you can load between, similiar to older video games with loading zones (In relation to scenes directly in unity).\nEssentially, a VRChat World would have a 'main scene' that by default you'd load into. Then, either by the menu or from a source in the world itself, you could 'load' into other scenes while still being in the same 'world'.\nThis would allow map creators to have the freedom to make elaborate experiences while reducing loading burdens on users by having them only load one initial scene, and then accessing adjacent scenes voluntarily!\nThis process could also be described as Dynamic Loading, which is used in multiple video games. Just as it takes time to load a new VRChat world, having a more minor loading process between scenes in one world would be sufficient in fitting more content into one VRChat world for those who choose to!",
